# Switchyard — Server Start
# Records the server startup banner and access code

Output docs/tapes/start.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.5

Type "npm start"
Enter
Sleep 6s

# Show the banner
Sleep 4s

Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
